#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:4
msgid "v1.4.0"
msgstr "v1.4.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v1.4.0 is a foundational imlib reorganization. ``find_blobs()`` / "
"``find_markers()`` were rewritten for direct color-threshold tracking, many "
"standalone image methods were folded into blob tuples, and several image "
"methods were renamed (``subimg`` → ``copy``, ``blit`` → ``replace``, "
"``find_eyes`` → ``find_eye``, ``compress`` → ``compressed``). It also adds "
":func:`sensor.get_fb` / AGC / AEC toggles and ~60 example scripts. This is a"
" heavily breaking release — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v1.4.0 是一次奠基性的 imlib 重組。\\ ``find_blobs()``\\ ／\\ ``find_markers()`` "
"被重寫以支援直接色彩閾值追蹤，許多獨立的影像方法被併入色塊元組，且數個影像方法被重新命名（\\ ``subimg`` → ``copy``\\ 、\\ "
"``blit`` → ``replace``\\ 、\\ ``find_eyes`` → ``find_eye``\\ 、\\ ``compress``"
" → ``compressed``\\ ）。它也新增了 :func:`sensor.get_fb`\\ ／AGC／AEC 切換，以及約 60 "
"個範例指令碼。這是一次破壞性極大的版本——請閱讀下方的破壞性變更。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本頁內容"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:20
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "重點摘要"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Color-based blob tracking** — ``find_blobs()`` takes color thresholds "
"directly and returns a flat list of blob tuples."
msgstr "**基於色彩的色塊追蹤**\\ ——\\ ``find_blobs()`` 直接接受色彩閾值，並回傳扁平的色塊元組清單。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Imlib cleanup** — ``subimg()`` → ``copy()``, ``blit()`` → ``replace()``, "
"``find_eyes()`` → ``find_eye()``, ``compress()`` → ``compressed()``."
msgstr ""
"**Imlib 清理**\\ ——\\ ``subimg()`` → ``copy()``\\ 、\\ ``blit()`` → "
"``replace()``\\ 、\\ ``find_eyes()`` → ``find_eye()``\\ 、\\ ``compress()`` → "
"``compressed()``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:26
msgid "**Sensor** — added :func:`sensor.get_fb` and AGC/AEC enable toggles."
msgstr "**感測器**\\ ——新增 :func:`sensor.get_fb` 與 AGC/AEC 啟用切換。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:27
msgid "**~60 example scripts** added/expanded."
msgstr "新增／擴充約 **60 個範例指令碼**\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** the blob API, removed image methods, and several renames — see"
" the breaking changes."
msgstr "**破壞性變更：** 色塊 API、移除的影像方法，以及數項重新命名——詳見破壞性變更。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:32
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Sensor** — added :func:`sensor.get_fb` (retrieve the last snapshot "
"framebuffer), ``sensor.set_gain_ctrl(enable)`` (toggle AGC), and "
"``sensor.set_exposure_ctrl(enable)`` (toggle AEC)."
msgstr ""
"**感測器**\\ ——新增 :func:`sensor.get_fb`\\ （取得最後一次快照的影格緩衝區）、\\ "
"``sensor.set_gain_ctrl(enable)``\\ （切換 AGC）與 "
"``sensor.set_exposure_ctrl(enable)``\\ （切換 AEC）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Image** — image subscript (``img[i]``) now supports both reading and "
"writing pixels (grayscale / RGB565 / JPEG); added an in-place "
"``image.compress()`` and a ``quality=`` keyword on the JPEG functions; "
"``find_blobs()`` / ``find_markers()`` / ``find_features()`` now return an "
"empty (iterable) list instead of a non-list when nothing is found."
msgstr ""
"**影像**\\ ——影像下標（\\ ``img[i]``\\ ）現在同時支援讀取與寫入像素（灰階／RGB565／JPEG）；新增就地的 "
"``image.compress()`` 以及 JPEG 函式上的 ``quality=`` 關鍵字；\\ ``find_blobs()``\\ ／\\"
" ``find_markers()``\\ ／\\ ``find_features()`` 現在於找不到結果時回傳空的（可迭代）清單，而非非清單值。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:42
msgid ""
"Added ~60 example scripts (board control, image filters, color tracking, "
"face / eye / feature detection, WiFi shield) and a second iris-detection "
"example."
msgstr "新增約 60 個範例指令碼（開發板控制、影像濾波器、色彩追蹤、人臉／眼睛／特徵偵測、WiFi 擴充板），以及第二個虹膜偵測範例。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:47
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他變更與改進"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:49
msgid "``image.histeq()`` now works on RGB565 images, not just grayscale."
msgstr "``image.histeq()`` 現在可用於 RGB565 影像，而不僅限於灰階。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:52
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "錯誤修正"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:54
msgid ""
"Initialized :class:`pyb.DAC` on boot so the DAC works (#121), fixed a broken"
" ``image.dilate()``, the WINC ``client.send()`` zero-byte corruption, blob "
"merge re-iteration, a file-buffer reinitialization bug that broke the "
"filesystem after first use, the thermopile ``To_min`` / ``To_max`` "
"computation (#113), and applied an upstream MicroPython HAL I2C/DMA patch."
msgstr ""
"於開機時初始化 :class:`pyb.DAC` 使 DAC 可正常運作（#121），修正了損壞的 ``image.dilate()``\\ 、WINC"
" ``client.send()`` 的零位元組損毀、色塊合併的重新迭代、一個導致首次使用後檔案系統失效的檔案緩衝區重新初始化錯誤、熱電堆的 "
"``To_min``\\ ／\\ ``To_max`` 計算（#113），並套用了上游 MicroPython HAL I2C/DMA 修補。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:61
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "硬體與開發板支援"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:63
msgid "**WiFi shield** — WINC1500 updated to Rev-B board files."
msgstr "**WiFi 擴充板**\\ ——WINC1500 更新至 Rev-B 開發板檔案。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:64
msgid ":class:`pyb.DAC` — DAC peripheral enabled."
msgstr ":class:`pyb.DAC`\\ ——已啟用 DAC 周邊裝置。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:67
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "破壞性 API 變更"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:69
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v1.3.0 and v1.4.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"v1.3.0 與 v1.4.0 之間使用者可見的 API 破壞性變更。範圍：\\ ``modules/`` 中的 Python C 模組與 "
"``scripts/libraries/`` 中的 Python 函式庫。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:72
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "每項變更都標註其影響程度："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:74
msgid ""
"*major* — affects most scripts that used the feature; you will need to port "
"code."
msgstr "*重大*\\ ——影響大部分使用該功能的指令碼；您需要移植程式碼。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:76
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; only affects scripts that used it."
msgstr "*次要*\\ ——範圍狹窄的 API；僅影響使用到它的指令碼。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:78
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v1_4_0_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"各項變更依此順序按影響程度分組。若您只想移植程式碼，請跳至結尾的\\ :ref:`遷移檢查清單 <v1_4_0_migration>`\\ "
"。每個提交雜湊都連結至其在 GitHub 上的差異。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:85
msgid "``find_blobs()`` / ``find_markers()`` rewritten *(major)*"
msgstr "``find_blobs()``\\ ／\\ ``find_markers()`` 已重寫 *(重大)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:87
msgid ""
"``image.find_blobs()`` / ``find_markers()`` were rewritten for color-based "
"tracking: you now pass color thresholds (and an optional filter function) "
"directly instead of operating on a pre-segmented image, and the result is a "
"single flat list of 10-element blob tuples (with a color-code field) instead"
" of a nested per-color tree. Rework color-tracking scripts to pass color "
"thresholds and iterate the flat list."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_blobs()``\\ ／\\ ``find_markers()`` "
"被重寫以支援基於色彩的追蹤：您現在直接傳入色彩閾值（以及選用的濾波函式），而非對預先分割的影像進行操作，且結果是單一扁平的 10 "
"元素色塊元組清單（含色碼欄位），而非巢狀的逐色彩樹狀結構。請重構色彩追蹤指令碼，改為傳入色彩閾值並迭代扁平清單。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:94
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `d1ff36602 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/d1ff36602>`__, `16daeb83a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/16daeb83a>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `d1ff36602 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/d1ff36602>`__, "
"`16daeb83a <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/16daeb83a>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:100
msgid "Standalone image methods removed *(major)*"
msgstr "移除獨立的影像方法 *(重大)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:102
msgid ""
":class:`image.threshold`, ``image.centroid()``, "
"``image.orientation_radians()``, ``image.orientation_degrees()``, and "
"``image.pixels()`` were removed. The centroid / orientation / pixel-count "
"data is now available as fields of the blob tuples returned by "
"``find_blobs()``."
msgstr ""
":class:`image.threshold`\\ 、\\ ``image.centroid()``\\ 、\\ "
"``image.orientation_radians()``\\ 、\\ ``image.orientation_degrees()`` 與 "
"``image.pixels()`` 已被移除。形心／方向／像素計數資料現在可作為 ``find_blobs()`` 所回傳色塊元組的欄位取得。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:107
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `9e5d379c1 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9e5d379c1>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `9e5d379c1 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9e5d379c1>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:112
msgid "Imlib method renames *(major)*"
msgstr "Imlib 方法重新命名 *(重大)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:114
msgid ""
"Several image methods were renamed/reworked: ``image.subimg()`` → "
"``image.copy()``, ``image.blit()`` → ``image.replace()``, and "
"``image.blend()`` was changed to match the other two-image ops. The "
"``image.scale()`` / ``scaled()`` / ``rainbow()`` methods were removed "
"(``rainbow`` moved to the FIR module). Update calls to the new names."
msgstr ""
"數個影像方法被重新命名／重構：\\ ``image.subimg()`` → ``image.copy()``\\ 、\\ "
"``image.blit()`` → ``image.replace()``\\ ，且 ``image.blend()`` "
"已變更以與其他兩種雙影像運算一致。\\ ``image.scale()``\\ ／\\ ``scaled()``\\ ／\\ ``rainbow()``"
" 方法已被移除（\\ ``rainbow`` 移至 FIR 模組）。請更新呼叫為新名稱。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:120
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `b534dc6ff <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b534dc6ff>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `b534dc6ff <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b534dc6ff>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:125
msgid "``find_eyes()`` renamed to ``find_eye()`` *(minor)*"
msgstr "``find_eyes()`` 重新命名為 ``find_eye()`` *(次要)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:127
msgid ""
"``image.find_eyes()`` was renamed to ``image.find_eye()`` and now returns a "
"2-tuple iris ``(x, y)`` instead of the previous eyes tuple. Rename the call "
"and update the return handling."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_eyes()`` 已重新命名為 ``image.find_eye()``\\ ，且現在回傳虹膜的 2 元組 ``(x, "
"y)``\\ ，而非先前的眼睛元組。請重新命名呼叫並更新回傳值的處理方式。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:131
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `7a01a9bed <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7a01a9bed>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `7a01a9bed <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7a01a9bed>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:136
msgid "``image.compress()`` renamed to ``compressed()`` *(minor)*"
msgstr "``image.compress()`` 重新命名為 ``compressed()`` *(次要)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:138
msgid ""
"``image.compress()`` (which returned a new JPEG image) was renamed to "
"``image.compressed()``; the new ``image.compress()`` instead compresses the "
"image in place and returns ``None``. ``image.save()`` also gained a "
"``quality=`` keyword and now returns ``None`` instead of ``True``. Migrate "
"``img.compress(q)`` (expecting a returned image) to "
"``img.compressed(quality=q)``."
msgstr ""
"``image.compress()``\\ （原本回傳新的 JPEG 影像）已重新命名為 ``image.compressed()``\\ ；新的 "
"``image.compress()`` 改為就地壓縮影像並回傳 ``None``\\ 。\\ ``image.save()`` 也新增了 "
"``quality=`` 關鍵字，且現在回傳 ``None`` 而非 ``True``\\ 。請將 ``img.compress(q)``\\ "
"（預期回傳影像）遷移為 ``img.compressed(quality=q)``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:145
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `367e5fdd3 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/367e5fdd3>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `367e5fdd3 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/367e5fdd3>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:150
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "遷移檢查清單"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:152
msgid "For a clean port to v1.4.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "若要乾淨地移植到 v1.4.0，通常需要進行的工作為："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:154
msgid ""
"Rework color-tracking code to pass color thresholds to ``find_blobs()`` / "
"``find_markers()`` and iterate the flat blob-tuple list (:ref:`the "
"find_blobs rewrite <v1_4_0_findblobs>`)."
msgstr ""
"重構色彩追蹤程式碼，改為將色彩閾值傳入 ``find_blobs()``\\ ／\\ ``find_markers()`` "
"並迭代扁平的色塊元組清單（\\ :ref:`find_blobs 的重寫 <v1_4_0_findblobs>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:157
msgid ""
"Read centroid / orientation / pixel data from the blob tuples instead of the"
" removed standalone methods (:ref:`the removed image methods "
"<v1_4_0_removed>`)."
msgstr "改為從色塊元組讀取形心／方向／像素資料，而非已移除的獨立方法（\\ :ref:`移除的影像方法 <v1_4_0_removed>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:160
msgid ""
"Rename ``subimg`` → ``copy``, ``blit`` → ``replace``, fix ``blend()`` calls,"
" and replace ``scale`` / ``scaled`` / ``rainbow`` (:ref:`the imlib renames "
"<v1_4_0_imlibrename>`)."
msgstr ""
"將 ``subimg`` → ``copy``\\ 、\\ ``blit`` → ``replace`` 重新命名，修正 ``blend()`` "
"呼叫，並替換 ``scale``\\ ／\\ ``scaled``\\ ／\\ ``rainbow``\\ （\\ :ref:`imlib 重新命名 "
"<v1_4_0_imlibrename>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:163
msgid ""
"Rename ``find_eyes()`` → ``find_eye()`` (:ref:`the find_eye rename "
"<v1_4_0_findeye>`) and ``compress()`` → ``compressed()`` (:ref:`the compress"
" rename <v1_4_0_compress>`)."
msgstr ""
"將 ``find_eyes()`` → ``find_eye()``\\ （\\ :ref:`find_eye 重新命名 "
"<v1_4_0_findeye>`\\ ）與 ``compress()`` → ``compressed()``\\ （\\ "
":ref:`compress 重新命名 <v1_4_0_compress>`\\ ）重新命名。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:168
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "所有其他指令碼皆可不經修改地執行。"
